to use channel authority. For custom name resolvers, use an explicit `scheme://...` target.\n\nFor automatic capture, use this experimental API instead of registering the interceptor directly:\n\n```java\nExperimental.addClientInterceptor(telemetry, channelBuilder);\n```\n\n`Experimental` is in `io.opentelemetry.instrumentation.grpc.v1_6.internal`. Automatic capture depends on gRPC's internal API on 1.64.0 and newer, falling back to authority on older versions or unsupported builders. The Java agent uses this automatic path.\n\nRemove `GrpcRequest.getLogicalHost()` and `getLogicalPort()` for 3.0. Use `getServerAddress()` and `getServerPort()` instead. `getServerPort()` returns `null` rather than `-1` when the port is unavailable.\n\n<!--\nCHANGELOG.md is generated from merged pull requests. Do not add an entry unless this PR introduces\na deprecation or breaking change.\n-->","title":"Populate gRPC `server.address` and `server.port` from channel targets"},"mode":"publish","pr":16161,"protocol":"git-candidate-v1","publication":{"auth_mode":"fine_grained_pat","authorized_actor_id":218610,"authorized_at":1792731001,"generation":5,"max_pipelines":5,"phase":"fedb1c3c2a8e42bf91c0ba23cb97db64","profile":"git-candidate-v1","required_checks":[]},"repo":"open-telemetry/opentelemetry-java-instrumentation","repo_id":210933087,"request_id":"d36996021d884a659a362b5be94255b7","schema":2,"source_private":false,"target_private":false,"workflow_ref":"review-loop-revisions/98fb6cdde0b957dd9fac1921637140b3abe6e57b","workflow_revision":"98fb6cdde0b957dd9fac1921637140b3abe6e57b"},"run":{"attempt":1,"conclusion":"success","id":39902504150,"url":"https://github.com/trask/copilot-workflows/actions/runs/39902504150"},"schema":2,"seen_findings":[],"seen_inline_findings":[],"seen_missed_findings":[],"stage":"publish_pending","verification_run":{"attempt":1,"id":39905097865}}